+- Schemathesis: maximum `noise_max_mut_NEW=3`; maximum per-row `noise_mean_mut_NEW=2.5`, scout LOOSE p100 s1-এ (`P/fuzzer_noise_cross_seed.csv:59`)। Scout STRICT s1-তেও max=3 (`P/fuzzer_noise_cross_seed.csv:65`)।
